# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A lit marquee and a text SLOT in one scene: the name comes from slot 0
# (POST /api/text, or the console's text box), the greeting crawls under an
# animated cake, over rainbow confetti (Twinkle's rainbow palette, a touch
# dimmed so the text reads). Firework-burst sprites, ADDED, are the poppers,
# going off behind the cake's shoulders. Designed at 32x32 (`U`): the card
# zooms to fill any panel.
S - Happy Birthday
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 85 none fill 1
N Confetti
I @pat/twinkle
C sliderPalette 196608
C sliderDensity 1310720
L sprite 17 3 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Popper
I @spr/firework-burst
A 9
L sprite 0 6 0 0 add 100 none fill 3
N Popper 2
I @spr/firework-burst
A 7
L sprite 8 7 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Cake
I @spr/cake
L text 0 0 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Name
T slot 0
F tiny ffd166 c none 0
L text 0 24 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Greeting
T lit HAPPY BIRTHDAY
F regular ffffff l left 18
